sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Card payment with a decline path
accDescr: The customer pays, the shop asks the payment provider to charge the card. If approved, the shop confirms the order. If declined, the shop asks for another card and keeps the basket.
participant Customer
participant Shop
participant Provider as Payment provider
Customer->>Shop: Pay for order
Shop->>Provider: Charge card
alt Approved
Provider-->>Shop: Approved
Shop-->>Customer: Show order confirmation
else Declined
Provider-->>Shop: Declined
Shop-->>Customer: Ask for another card, keep basket
end
